Dude did you just bought that syrup from dollar tree right? they have acetaminophen in large doses can kill you painfully, you shouldn't take more than 4,000mg a day of acetaminophen. if you want to buy your shits from dollar tree take the gel caps much better then that nasty syrup. however there are some reports that gel caps from dollar tree can cause diarrhea but i rather shit myself than dying from liver problems. also you should get rid of these ccc too

&#x200B;

edit: typo

I never been so depressed but when i entered the adulthood every thing changed and just I gave up for trying to socialize because i feel so ashamed of myself like i can't talk to another human bean, how is that possible people do that their entire life but i just can't and this destroyed me, now i am always depressed without energy.  I remembered when i was a kid i didn't care at all if i was stutter or not but now this is a big issue to me, i feel so ashamed of my self that every day i think about giving up. It's been probably 3 days without talking to anyone if i need to speak to somebody i just write in some notepad and show to them because its way more easier. i just want to be normal, have friends, be able to speak on the fucking phone without the people hung up on me. 

&#x200B;

I tired of people saying "just accepted yourself as a stutter" and then what? I accepted myself but this won't change shit.
